      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "FriendsPerLocation issue is a known bug, we'll be fixing it and also removing the extra keys at that same time.\n\nIn the meantime, if you have an *extremely* large number of friends, you'll eventually have enough keys to cause issues. Feel free to check and remove those keys to regain the lost perf in the social menu.\n\nI've moved this post to Bug Reports, as Feature Requests isn't the appropriate place.",
